/** @mainpage Qore Cairo Module

    @tableofcontents

    @section cairointro Cairo Module Introduction

    The @c cairo module provides Qore bindings for the
    <a href="https://www.cairographics.org/">Cairo 2D graphics library</a>,
    enabling creation and manipulation of vector graphics in SVG, PostScript,
    and EPS formats, as well as PNG raster images.

    With optional <a href="https://wiki.gnome.org/Projects/LibRsvg">librsvg</a>
    support, the module can also load and render existing SVG files,
    converting them to PNG, PostScript, EPS, or PDF.

    @section cairofeatures Features

    - Create SVG documents from drawing commands
    - Create PostScript and EPS documents from drawing commands
    - Create and manipulate PNG raster images
    - Path operations: lines, curves, arcs, rectangles
    - Text rendering with font face and size control
    - Linear and radial gradient patterns
    - Surface patterns for image compositing
    - Affine transformations: translate, rotate, scale, matrix
    - State management: save/restore, line styles, dash patterns, fill rules
    - Multi-page PostScript output
    - Recording surfaces for deferred rendering
    - SVG input, rendering, and format conversion (requires librsvg)
    - Data provider integration for Qorus workflow automation

    @section cairoclasses Cairo Classes

    - @ref Qore::Cairo::CairoSurface "CairoSurface" - Drawing surface for
      SVG, PostScript, EPS, PNG, and recording output
    - @ref Qore::Cairo::CairoContext "CairoContext" - Drawing context with
      path, text, transform, and state operations
    - @ref Qore::Cairo::CairoPattern "CairoPattern" - Linear/radial
      gradients, solid colors, and surface patterns
    - @ref Qore::Cairo::CairoSvgReader "CairoSvgReader" - SVG file reader
      and renderer (requires librsvg)

    @section cairohashdecls Hashdecls

    - @ref Qore::Cairo::CairoSurfaceInfo "CairoSurfaceInfo" - Surface type,
      dimensions, and format information
    - @ref Qore::Cairo::CairoMatrix "CairoMatrix" - 2D affine
      transformation matrix (xx, yx, xy, yy, x0, y0)
    - @ref Qore::Cairo::CairoTextExtents "CairoTextExtents" - Text
      measurement: bearings, dimensions, and advance values

    @section cairodataprov CairoDataProvider Module

    The @ref CairoDataProvider::CairoDataProvider "CairoDataProvider" module
    exposes Cairo operations through Qore's DataProvider API for use in
    Qorus workflows and the @c qdp command-line tool.

    See the <a href="../../CairoDataProvider/html/index.html">CairoDataProvider
    module documentation</a> for complete API reference.

    @subsection cairodp_actions Data Provider Actions

    <b>SVG actions:</b>
    - @c svg/create - Create SVG from declarative draw commands
    - @c svg/get-info - Get SVG dimensions and metadata (requires librsvg)
    - @c svg/to-png - Convert SVG to PNG raster image (requires librsvg)
    - @c svg/to-ps - Convert SVG to PostScript (requires librsvg)
    - @c svg/to-eps - Convert SVG to EPS (requires librsvg)
    - @c svg/to-pdf - Convert SVG to PDF (requires librsvg and PDF support)

    <b>Image actions:</b>
    - @c image/create - Create PNG from declarative draw commands
    - @c image/get-info - Get PNG image dimensions and format
    - @c image/draw - Draw on an existing PNG image
    - @c image/resize - Resize a PNG image
    - @c image/crop - Crop a region from a PNG image
    - @c image/composite - Composite an overlay image onto a base image
    - @c image/rotate - Rotate a PNG image by a specified angle
    - @c image/to-svg - Convert PNG to SVG
    - @c image/to-ps - Convert PNG to PostScript
    - @c image/to-eps - Convert PNG to EPS
    - @c image/to-pdf - Convert PNG to PDF (requires PDF support)

    <b>PostScript actions:</b>
    - @c postscript/create - Create PostScript or EPS from draw commands

    <b>PDF actions:</b> (requires PDF support)
    - @c pdf/create - Create PDF from declarative draw commands

    <b>Text actions:</b>
    - @c text/measure - Measure text dimensions and bearing
    - @c text/get-font-metrics - Get font metrics (ascent, descent, height)
    - @c text/render - Render text to a PNG image

    @subsection cairodp_examples qdp Examples

    @par Create an SVG with a rectangle and text
    @code{.bash}
qdp 'cairo{}/svg/create' width=400,height=200,output_path=label.svg,commands='({"op":"set_source_rgb","r":0,"g":0,"b":0},{"op":"set_line_width","width":2},{"op":"rectangle","x":10,"y":10,"width":380,"height":180},{"op":"stroke"},{"op":"text","text":"Shipping Label","x":20,"y":50,"family":"Helvetica","size":24,"weight":"bold"})'
    @endcode

    @par Convert SVG to PNG (requires librsvg)
    @code{.bash}
qdp 'cairo{}/svg/to-png' input_path=logo.svg,output_path=logo.png,width=256,height=256
    @endcode

    @par Create a PNG image
    @code{.bash}
qdp 'cairo{}/image/create' width=200,height=200,output_path=circle.png,commands='({"op":"set_source_rgba","r":1,"g":0,"b":0,"a":1},{"op":"arc","x":100,"y":100,"radius":80,"angle1":0,"angle2":6.283},{"op":"fill"})'
    @endcode

    @par Create a PostScript document
    @code{.bash}
qdp 'cairo{}/postscript/create' width=612,height=792,output_path=doc.ps,commands='({"op":"text","text":"Hello World","x":72,"y":720,"family":"Helvetica","size":24},{"op":"rectangle","x":50,"y":50,"width":512,"height":692},{"op":"stroke"})'
    @endcode

    @par Get PNG image info
    @code{.bash}
qdp 'cairo{}/image/get-info' input_path=photo.png
    @endcode

    @subsection cairodp_drawcmds Draw Commands Reference

    All create and draw actions accept a @c commands field containing a list
    of draw command hashes. Each hash must have an @c op key:

    <table>
    <tr><th>op</th><th>Parameters</th><th>Description</th></tr>
    <tr><td>@c set_source_rgb</td><td>r, g, b (0.0-1.0)</td><td>Set drawing color</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c set_source_rgba</td><td>r, g, b, a (0.0-1.0)</td><td>Set drawing color with alpha</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c set_line_width</td><td>width</td><td>Set line width</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c set_font</td><td>family, size, *slant, *weight</td><td>Set font face and size</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c move_to</td><td>x, y</td><td>Move cursor</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c line_to</td><td>x, y</td><td>Line to point</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c curve_to</td><td>x1, y1, x2, y2, x3, y3</td><td>Cubic Bezier curve</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c arc</td><td>x, y, radius, angle1, angle2</td><td>Circular arc</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c rectangle</td><td>x, y, width, height</td><td>Rectangle path</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c close_path</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Close current path</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c stroke</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Stroke current path</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c fill</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Fill current path</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c paint</td><td>*alpha</td><td>Paint entire surface (optional alpha)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c text</td><td>text, x, y, *family, *size, *slant, *weight</td><td>Draw text at position</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c save</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Save graphics state</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c restore</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Restore graphics state</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c translate</td><td>x, y</td><td>Translate origin</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c rotate</td><td>angle (radians)</td><td>Rotate coordinate system</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c scale</td><td>x, y</td><td>Scale coordinate system</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c set_dash</td><td>dashes (list), *offset</td><td>Set dash pattern</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c set_line_cap</td><td>cap ("butt"/"round"/"square")</td><td>Line cap style</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c set_line_join</td><td>join ("miter"/"round"/"bevel")</td><td>Line join style</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c set_fill_rule</td><td>rule ("winding"/"even-odd")</td><td>Fill rule</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c linear_gradient</td><td>x0, y0, x1, y1, stops</td><td>Set linear gradient source</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c radial_gradient</td><td>cx0, cy0, r0, cx1, cy1, r1, stops</td><td>Set radial gradient source</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c image</td><td>*path, *data, x, y, *width, *height</td><td>Draw PNG image</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c show_page</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Next page (multi-page PS)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c clip</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Clip to current path</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c new_path</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Clear current path</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c new_sub_path</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Start new sub-path</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c stroke_preserve</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Stroke without clearing path</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c fill_preserve</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Fill without clearing path</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c clip_preserve</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Clip without clearing path</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c text_path</td><td>text</td><td>Add text outlines to path</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@c identity_matrix</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Reset transformation matrix</td></tr>
    </table>

    Gradient @c stops are lists of hashes with keys: @c offset (0.0-1.0),
    @c r, @c g, @c b, and optional @c a.

    @section cairodeps Dependencies

    - <a href="https://www.cairographics.org/">Cairo</a> (required) - 2D
      graphics library
    - <a href="https://wiki.gnome.org/Projects/LibRsvg">librsvg</a>
      (optional) - SVG input, rendering, and format conversion

    @section cairopackages OS Packages

    @subsection cairopackages_ubuntu Ubuntu

    @code{.bash}
sudo apt-get update
sudo apt-get install -y cmake pkg-config libcairo2-dev
# Optional: SVG input support
sudo apt-get install -y librsvg2-dev
    @endcode

    @subsection cairopackages_alpine Alpine

    @code{.bash}
sudo apk add --no-cache cmake pkgconfig cairo-dev
# Optional: SVG input support
sudo apk add --no-cache librsvg-dev
    @endcode

    @subsection cairopackages_fedora Fedora

    @code{.bash}
sudo dnf install -y cmake pkgconf-pkg-config cairo-devel
# Optional: SVG input support
sudo dnf install -y librsvg2-devel
    @endcode

    @subsection cairopackages_macports MacPorts

    @code{.bash}
sudo port install cmake pkgconfig cairo
# Optional: SVG input support
sudo port install librsvg
    @endcode

    @section cairoreleasenotes Release Notes

    @subsection cairo_1_0 cairo Module Version 1.0.0
    - Initial release
    - SVG, PostScript, EPS, and PDF surface output
    - PNG image surface creation and manipulation
    - Drawing context with path, text, and transform operations
    - Pattern support (linear/radial gradients, solid colors, surface patterns)
    - Masking operations (pattern and surface masks)
    - Recording surfaces for deferred rendering
    - Optional SVG input via librsvg (get-info, to-png, to-ps, to-eps, to-pdf)
    - CairoDataProvider module with 23 data provider actions for Qorus integration:
      - SVG: create, get-info, to-png, to-ps, to-eps, to-pdf
      - Image: create, get-info, draw, resize, crop, composite, rotate, to-svg,
        to-ps, to-eps, to-pdf
      - PostScript: create
      - PDF: create
      - Text: measure, get-font-metrics, render

